    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- Invoices carry `number` (\"INV-000001\", per organization, in creation order, never reused), and every invoice answer shows it. Snapshot v3 stores the numbers and each organization's next number.\n- Save writes version 3 atomically: a temp file in the same folder, renamed over the target, with no temp file left behind. Load reads v1, v2 and v3, numbering older invoices by (created_at, ID). `snapshot.Upgrade` backs up older files byte for byte to `\u003cpath\u003e.v\u003cN\u003e.bak` and leaves v3 and newer files alone. Newer versions fail with `ErrUnsupportedVersion`.\n- Checked by `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` \n...[truncated]",
